    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you simulate a chicken living on a farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the farm, you can:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with animal friends, feed them fruit, unlock skins, play basketball, annoy NPCs, peck things, throw fruit, and more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The animals you've fed will follow the direction of your clucking. A little mouse will become your partner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/667f4fb280f661c60412cc54a0b06fe5.poster.avif?t=1754291514\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/667f4fb280f661c60412cc54a0b06fe5.webm?t=1754291514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/667f4fb280f661c60412cc54a0b06fe5.mp4?t=1754291514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game currently includes three skins that can be unlocked by discovering them in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/7c6d5b35908d551b5b04e4fba5abf4d6.avif?t=1754291514\" width=128 height=128 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/6b853596efcc5be3a22e74e64070916d.avif?t=1754291514\" width=128 height=128 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/37e905f0f6c2164c7c984af3c08290d3.avif?t=1754291514\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The farm also contains some Easter eggs and internet memes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to aimlessly wandering around, you can also:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept farm tasks, complete the farm people's stories about friendship, love, and family, and experience healing moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the beloved chicken on the farm, winning the farmer's hugs and praise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/d1692ad9a0f70ad41381b9e3965151b7.poster.avif?t=1754291514\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/d1692ad9a0f70ad41381b9e3965151b7.webm?t=1754291514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/d1692ad9a0f70ad41381b9e3965151b7.mp4?t=1754291514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After completing all tasks, you finish the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When it rains, bad guys will come to attack you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They will destroy the farm, and if the damage is too high, the game will end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter key NPCs, they will come to help you defend the farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/91686dc8a76db308cdf23cffa0a7a840.avif?t=1754291514\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some tasks need to be completed in sequence, and if you annoy NPCs, some of them will always dislike you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you annoy too many NPCs, you will be chased away by them and will never be able to return to the town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/6023713691e9b2c914f01f39dc48af75.poster.avif?t=1754291514\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/6023713691e9b2c914f01f39dc48af75.webm?t=1754291514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/6023713691e9b2c914f01f39dc48af75.mp4?t=1754291514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/61fc5e2735a9174ce541ce1efb2710e9.webp?t=1754291514\" data-has-big width=800 height=29 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm resources are limited and cannot be restored once destroyed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember to use boxes to transport fruit and improve efficiency.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you simulate a chicken living on a farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the farm, you can:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with animal friends, feed them fruit, unlock skins, play basketball, annoy NPCs, peck things, throw fruit, and more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The animals you've fed will follow the direction of your clucking. A little mouse will become your partner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/667f4fb280f661c60412cc54a0b06fe5.poster.avif?t=1754291514\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/667f4fb280f661c60412cc54a0b06fe5.webm?t=1754291514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/667f4fb280f661c60412cc54a0b06fe5.mp4?t=1754291514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game currently includes three skins that can be unlocked by discovering them in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/7c6d5b35908d551b5b04e4fba5abf4d6.avif?t=1754291514\" width=128 height=128 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/6b853596efcc5be3a22e74e64070916d.avif?t=1754291514\" width=128 height=128 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/37e905f0f6c2164c7c984af3c08290d3.avif?t=1754291514\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The farm also contains some Easter eggs and internet memes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to aimlessly wandering around, you can also:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept farm tasks, complete the farm people's stories about friendship, love, and family, and experience healing moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the beloved chicken on the farm, winning the farmer's hugs and praise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/d1692ad9a0f70ad41381b9e3965151b7.poster.avif?t=1754291514\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/d1692ad9a0f70ad41381b9e3965151b7.webm?t=1754291514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/d1692ad9a0f70ad41381b9e3965151b7.mp4?t=1754291514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After completing all tasks, you finish the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When it rains, bad guys will come to attack you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They will destroy the farm, and if the damage is too high, the game will end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter key NPCs, they will come to help you defend the farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/91686dc8a76db308cdf23cffa0a7a840.avif?t=1754291514\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some tasks need to be completed in sequence, and if you annoy NPCs, some of them will always dislike you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you annoy too many NPCs, you will be chased away by them and will never be able to return to the town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/6023713691e9b2c914f01f39dc48af75.poster.avif?t=1754291514\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/6023713691e9b2c914f01f39dc48af75.webm?t=1754291514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/6023713691e9b2c914f01f39dc48af75.mp4?t=1754291514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721350/extras/61fc5e2735a9174ce541ce1efb2710e9.webp?t=1754291514\" data-has-big width=800 height=29 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm resources are limited and cannot be restored once destroyed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember to use boxes to transport fruit and improve efficiency.</p>",
